### Musician session (Jorge, profile 1) - JWT for the calls below
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU" }

> {% client.global.set("musician", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Account that is not the musician, a teacher or the owner (jwt.gate)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### NEXUS without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/status

### NEXUS status: aiConfigured, rubric keys, Enigma ladder, audio note
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/status
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}

### Request a Score Enigma for my own profile.
### 200 with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set (score, strengths, errors, exercises, recommendedLevel);
### 503 "NEXUS unavailable: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY not set" without it.
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "recordingUrl": "https://example.com/jorge-take-3.mp3",
  "rubricJson": "{\"technique\": 8, \"timing\": 7, \"tone\": 8, \"expression\": 7, \"theory\": 6}",
  "notes": "Clean riffs; bends drift sharp in the bridge."
}

### Rubric outside 0..10 is 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "rubricJson": "{\"technique\": 11, \"timing\": 7, \"tone\": 8, \"expression\": 7, \"theory\": 6}"
}

### Someone else's profile without teacher/owner rights is 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "rubricJson": "{\"technique\": 8, \"timing\": 7, \"tone\": 8, \"expression\": 7, \"theory\": 6}"
}

### Unknown musician is 404
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "musicianProfileId": 999,
  "rubricJson": "{\"technique\": 8, \"timing\": 7, \"tone\": 8, \"expression\": 7, \"theory\": 6}"
}

### My evaluations, newest first (applied marks a verified on-chain level change)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/nexus/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{musician}}
